{'symbol': 'FSLR', 'date': '2019-11-18 22:30:00', 'title': 'FIRST SOLAR, INC. APPOINTS BYRON JEFFERS AS GLOBAL CONTROLLER, CHIEF ACCOUNTING OFFICER', 'text': 'EFFECTIVE NOVEMBER 18, 2019, BYRON JEFFERS HAS BEEN APPOINTED GLOBAL CONTROLLER, CHIEF ACCOUNTING OFFICER OF FIRST SOLAR, INC., REPORTING TO THE CHIEF FINANCIAL OFFICER. MR. JEFFERS JOINED FIRST SOLAR IN AUGUST 2012, SERVING IN SEVERAL SENIOR ACCOUNTING ROLES BEFORE BEING APPOINTED AS ITS SENIOR DIRECTOR OF FINANCIAL PLANNING AND ANALYSIS IN JUNE 2017. PRIOR TO JOINING FIRST SOLAR, MR. JEFFERS SERVED FOR SEVEN YEARS AS AN ASSURANCE MANAGER AT PRICEWATERHOUSECOOPERS LLP WITH PUBLIC ACCOUNTING EXPERIENCE WORKING WITH NUMEROUS COMPANIES ACROSS VARIOUS INDUSTRIES INCLUDING TECHNOLOGY, MANUFACTURING, AND RETAIL.'}